<p>I'm usually not a fan of long skips, but this kept me interested&#8230; all up until about the second half of the second exploration log, where I lost interest. I really had to force my way through the accompanying personal log. I don't know any of these characters, I don't know their backstory, I just clicked on this skip and it should work on its own. Which it does, up to that point. Then there's a lot of emotional exposition that doesn't work for me, because, again I don't know these characters, I'm not sure why or how they're ghosts or immortal or whatever, so a lot of that stuff falls flat.</p>
<p>I'm also not sure that you need the ISA article at the beginning. I guess it worked to pique my interest, but really, it adds nothing new to the article and doesn't say or give anything that's not in the SCP document itself.</p>
