			<div class="content" id="post-content-4015009">
									

<p>I love this article, definite upvote for me! Specifically enjoyed MacLaughlin sending the D back. There is, however, one thing that seems inconsistent or omitted:</p>
<p>Members of the MTF omega zero are all informational constructs already, and according to the article can &quot;[&#8230;] freely travel using SCP-2759-1's anomalous properties using an unknown vector.&quot; (the double &quot;using&quot; there feels odd to me but I'm not a native english speaker).</p>
<p>It was, and to an extend still is, unclear to me, how they were trying to get that MTF gear to transfer without someone dying on -1, unless the MTF omega 0 guys can initiate the transfer the same was as dying does. The way I understand it, MacLaughlin was only able to &quot;die&quot; that way because, in -E1, he was corporeal, unlike in our world.</p>
<p>Maybe I'm just misunderstanding or missing something. In any case, I very much enjoyed the connection to MTF omega zero :)</p>

